cats for 'em, try to get 'em turned.

564
00:39:19.254 --> 00:39:20.587
- Oh man.
- What?

565
00:39:21.462 --> 00:39:24.879
No, I'm just a big cat lover.
I got two of them myself.

566
00:39:24.962 --> 00:39:26.254
Oh. Okay.

567
00:39:26.337 --> 00:39:27.795
