617
00:43:08.295 --> 00:43:12.420
The way I see it,
you have two choices, two doors.

618
00:43:12.504 --> 00:43:16.337
One, you bend the knee
and join me in service, and you live.

619
00:43:16.420 --> 00:43:17.670
And two...

620
00:43:19.379 --> 00:43:20.379
